ndependence being restricted by machines.</span></div><div class="ielts-radio-group"><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="22" name="question_22" value="YES"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>YES</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="22" name="question_22" value="NO"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NO</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="22" name="question_22" value="NOT GIVEN"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> </span></label></div></div><div class="ielts-standalone-q" data-qnum="23"><div class="ielts-q-header"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">23</strong><span class="ielts-q-title"><span>If we want to ensure that machines act in our best interests, we all need to work together.</span></div><div class="ielts-radio-group"><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="23" name="question_23" value="YES"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>YES</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="23" name="question_23" value="NO"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NO</strong> </span></label><label class="ielts-radio-btn"><input type="radio" data-qnum="23" name="question_23" value="NOT GIVEN"><span class="ielts-radio-text"><strong>NOT GIVEN</strong> </span></label></div></div></div>
